<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Armor is psychically stripped to 0. Upon an impact of psychic throw, this character will detonate in a small radius.-->
  <VREA_PsychicallyWarped.description>此单位的护甲已被快速扭曲的多维度折跃门撕得粉碎。继续对其使用心灵投掷将会引发心灵连爆。</VREA_PsychicallyWarped.description>
  <!--EN: psychically warped-->
  <VREA_PsychicallyWarped.label>心灵扭曲</VREA_PsychicallyWarped.label>
  <!--EN: set-->
  <VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelSolidTendedWell>放</VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelSolidTendedWell>
  <!--EN: bandaged-->
  <VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelTendedWell>缠着绷带的</VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelTendedWell>
  <!--EN: sutured-->
  <VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelTendedWellInner>缝合的</VREA_Sear.comps.0.labelTendedWellInner>
  <!--EN: sear scar-->
  <VREA_Sear.comps.2.permanentLabel>灼伤疤痕</VREA_Sear.comps.2.permanentLabel>
  <!--EN: A sear.-->
  <VREA_Sear.description>折跃割伤伤口。</VREA_Sear.description>
  <!--EN: Seared off-->
  <VREA_Sear.injuryProps.destroyedLabel>被切除（折跃）</VREA_Sear.injuryProps.destroyedLabel>
  <!--EN: Seared out-->
  <VREA_Sear.injuryProps.destroyedOutLabel>被切掉（折跃）</VREA_Sear.injuryProps.destroyedOutLabel>
  <!--EN: sear-->
  <VREA_Sear.label>折跃</VREA_Sear.label>
  <!--EN: a sear-->
  <VREA_Sear.labelNoun>折跃割伤</VREA_Sear.labelNoun>
  <!--EN: This person has a direct link to a distant archotech, and part of their essence exists outside of our dimension. They are capable of using archon equipment, and in the event of death, they will skip back to another dimension only to return unscathed after some time has passed.-->
  <VRE_Transcendent.description>这种基因的携带者与遥远的超凡智能建立起了直接联系，且有部分本质留存在了我们所处的维度之外。他们可以使用并装备超凡战刃与超凡战甲，即使被杀死也会被折跃至另一维度，并在一段时间过后完好如初地回归。</VRE_Transcendent.description>
  <!--EN: transcendent-->
  <VRE_Transcendent.label>超凡飞升</VRE_Transcendent.label>
